  "target_label_zh": "预测疲劳强度 σw (MPa)",
  "model_file": "model.keras",
  "scaler_x_file": "scaler_X.pkl",
  "scaler_y_file": "scaler_y.pkl",
  "training_dataset_file": "training_dataset.xlsx",
  "notes": [
    "该版本直接读取上传的 model.keras 与 scaler 文件。",
    "输入顺序固定为 E、σb、R、σ-1。",
